# RELEASE SIGNING — how to enable signed release builds of "Nitflex"
#
# 1. Create a keystore (one time). Easiest: in Android Studio use
#       Build → Generate Signed App Bundle / APK → APK → Create new...
#    and save the .jks file into the project's root folder (next to this file).
#    Remember the passwords and alias you choose.
#
# 2. Copy this file to "keystore.properties" (remove the .example) and fill in
#    the values below. That real file is gitignored and never committed.
#
# 3. Build a signed release with:  ./gradlew assembleRelease
#    (or just keep using the Android Studio wizard, which signs for you.)

storeFile=nitflex-release.jks
storePassword=YOUR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
keyAlias=YOUR_KEY_ALIAS
keyPassword=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD
